  "tip": "<p>Map the requirement that says <i>minimal interruption</i> to operations that are <i>online</i>. For Cloud Bigtable prefer scaling nodes in place or autoscaling rather than migrations, restores, or export and import tasks that require endpoint changes.</p>",
